\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Every single word I utter,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  Every little thing I do -
\par  I must ask you, my Lord Jesus,
\par  Whether it seems right to you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Every day I'll ask these questions:
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  "Is this what my Saviour said?
\par  Would he let me take this action?
\par  Has Jesus me rightly led?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   "Am I really serving Jesus?
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0   Do I know this thing is right?
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Does he like the way I'm living?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Am I walking in the light?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  "While I claim to follow Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Am I living selfishly?
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Am I just the same as others,
\par Seeking wealth and luxury?"
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Keep me on the narrow pathway,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Test my thoughts and search my heart:
\par So, Lord Jesus, let me never
\par From your perfect will depart.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

